Package: com.nicksworks.mgxfix
Name: MGXFix
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Makes the 8BitDo Ultimate MGX work as a normal game controller. iOS already publishes the pad as a BLE HID device and matches it in the GameController database, but skips its mapping on a personality version check; this patches that in memory.
Maintainer: Nick's Works <hadobedo@gmail.com>
Author: Nick's Works (Hadobedo)
Homepage: https://github.com/hadobedo/mgxfix
Icon: https://hadobedo.github.io/repo/assets/mgxfix.png
